# Learning P4 


A useful repo to learn P4 is the following from [ETH Zurich](https://github.com/nsg-ethz/p4-learning). In order to use it you should create a virtual machine with Ubuntu 20.04 and then running the following command: 
```bash     
sudo apt update

sudo apt install curl 

curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nsg-ethz/p4-utils/master/install-tools/install-p4-dev.sh | bash
```
This command will install all the p4utils library need for following the tutorials. There are also this slides which you may find it useful also provided by [ETH Zurich](https://adv-net.ethz.ch/transcripts/programmability/). 